  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline A5 is a premium round co-polyester engineered for players who want precision, stability and elite spin without relying on aggressive shaped edges. Its refined polymer blend delivers exceptional snapback, low-friction response and strong tension stability. Racketpedia laboratory testing rated the 1.25 mm A5 a perfect 100/100 for spin, making it Toroline's highest-rated round string for spin performance. Its symmetrical round geometry also produces a clean, predictable launch angle and a connected, repeatable response for aggressive baseline play.",

    "zh": "Toroline A5 是一款高端圆形共聚酯球线，专为追求精准、稳定和高旋转表现的球员设计。它并不依赖锐利异形边缘制造旋转，而是通过极高的 Snapback、低摩擦响应和优秀弹性来提升球线回弹速度，从而产生大量旋转。Racketpedia 实验室测试中，1.25 毫米 A5 的旋转评分达到 100/100，是 Toroline 目前旋转评分最高的圆形球线。对称圆形结构同时带来非常稳定、可预测的出球角度和清晰连接感，非常适合积极进攻型底线球员。"
  },

